{"id":"00252","root":"uni00252_1","name":{"ja":"ナディア","en":"Nadia"},"title":{"ja":"【ハロウィン舞姫】","en":"【Halloween Dancing Princess】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ハロウィン舞姫】 ナディア","en":"【Halloween Dancing Princess】 Nadia"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-10-15","limited":true,"characterId":28,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の支配階級の出身の踊り子。その気になれば魔界の一角を牛耳れるほどの強力な魔力を有しているが、彼女はその力を舞に乗せ、見た者に様々な効果を与える踊り子として活動している。得意としているのは、見た者を癒し活力を分け与える舞。それとは別に、とてつもなく恐ろしい力を持つという『舞』も踊れるのだが、それは彼女自身により封印されている。強い力を持ちながら、自らを律し他人を助ける彼女は、力を至上とし他者を利用することに疑問を抱かない魔族社会にあってはかなりの変わり者であり、エドウィン・ブラックをはじめ多くの魔族からは敬遠されている。ただ、中にはそんなナディアの事を慕う者もいる。同じ支配階級の出身であるメイア・ブラッドロードは特に彼女をよく慕っていた。ハロウィンの日、ナディアが特別な装束に身を包んで舞うと、見た者の心は穏やかになり、お菓子を口に入れた時のような甘く幸せな気持ちになるという。","en":"Nadia is a dancer born into the ruling class of the Demon Realm. She possesses enough magical power to dominate a region of the realm if she wishes, yet she channels that strength into her performances, granting various effects to those who watch. Her signature dance heals and revitalizes observers. She also knows a terrifying \"dance\" of immense power, but she has sealed it away herself. Possessing great power yet choosing to discipline herself and aid others makes her a rarity among demon society, which values strength above all and views exploiting others as normal. Consequently, many demons, including Edwin Black, keep their distance, though some still admire her. Meia Brandford, also of the ruling class, holds her in especially high regard. On Halloween, when Nadia dons a special costume and dances, onlookers feel a gentle calm, as sweet and content as the moment they bite into candy."},"illustrator":"さくらんぼ","voiceActor":"手塚りょうこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00252_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[938,1876],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[79,158],"def":[104,208],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","350009"]},{"id":"uni00252_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1476,2952],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[108,216],"def":[158,316],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","350009","350010"]},{"id":"uni00252_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[2014,4015],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[137,275],"def":[212,427],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","350009","350010"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Natural damage"}]},"350009":{"slot":"skill1","id":350009,"name":{"ja":"スイートダンス"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"SPが低い味方３体のSPを中回復する"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"SPが低い味方３体のSPを中回復する"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"SPが低い味方３体のSPを中回復する"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"SPが低い味方３体のSPを中回復する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"SPが低い味方３体のSPを中回復する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"3 allies with the lowest SP: restore 40 SP","icon":"Healing_sp"}]},"350010":{"slot":"skill2","id":350010,"name":{"ja":"ステップ・オ・ウィスプ"},"hits":1,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"味方１体のATKとSPDを大アップする"}},{"level":2,"sp":245,"detail":{"ja":"味方１体のATKとSPDを大アップする"}},{"level":3,"sp":240,"detail":{"ja":"味方１体のATKとSPDを大アップする"}},{"level":4,"sp":235,"detail":{"ja":"味方１体のATKとSPDを大アップする"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"味方１体のATKとSPDを大アップする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 random ally: ATK +60% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_up"},{"text":"1 random ally: SPD +60% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_up"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"ハロウィン舞姫"},"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ユニットのSPDを小アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Natural allies: SPD +10%","icon":"spd_up"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":2,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00001",160],[1,"blo00004",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],